"P1488084897" "The Hellions broke into the van Horn mansion last night! No one was hurt, thank goodness, but the Hellions made off with some of Mimi van Horn's jewelry. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I've been asked to send a hero to recover the jewelry from the Hellions.</A> The van Horns have a lot of clout in this town, and they know how to use it."
