"P3140054263" "You know, I think I know why the Hellions were after this jewelry. Take a look at this sapphire necklace. When you tilt it this way, do you notice the rune that appears in the heart of the stone? It looks like this is actually the Jewel of Enki, an ancient artifact of nearly limitless power. It's a good thing you recovered it, {HeroName}! I doubt these Hellions have any idea of the powers they are playing with!"

