// Task - L1_P_Hellions_Errand2-GC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3593217307" "The Hellions have been gaining territory hand over fist. The more successful they are, the bolder their attacks get. I even heard that they tried to ambush some heroes the other day! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to show the Hellions they're not invincible.</A> If they keep making these attacks, we're going to have a tragedy on our hands."
// AcceptString :
"P2234577022" "Show the Hellions they're not invincible"
// SendOffString :
"P2259799081" "The Hellions are really starting to scare me, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2376765171" "Combat Hellion menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1263206196" "I need you to defeat a few more Hellions"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1959113958" "You have discouraged the Hellion attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1870543502" "Soon the Hellions will fear the name of {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - L1_P_Hellions_Errand1.2-GC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Artifact 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4083705024" "Rag doll"
// DetailString :
"P410639342" "This rag doll was taken off a defeated Hellion. The eyes are represented by sharp, black pieces of stone, and a red leather tongue protrudes sickly from the side of the doll's mouth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2465702703" "Another MAGI hero took this rag doll off a defeated Hellion yesterday. Pretty ugly, huh? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to take this doll to a contact of mine, Clarence Jackson.</A> He's a garbage man, and he sees a lot of things most people ignore. I'm thinking he might know what the Hellions would want with a thing like this."
// AcceptString :
"P1543072019" "Take the doll to Clarence Jackson"
// SendOffString :
"P1918921481" "Clarence has seen more things than most of us care to imagine."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3655457653" "Take doll to Jackson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1588842094" "I want Clarence to see that doll. I need to know what the Hellions are up to!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1018930864" "Here's the doll. Anything Clarence can tell us will help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3246636175" "Hey I picked up something like this in the trash the other day, then some Hellions came outta nowhere and rooted through my truck to get it back. They said something about it being an idol of power. I looked that up when I got home, and apparently these things give the owner the ability to control the will of others. I'm concerned by this, {HeroName}. How did the Hellions come to know about objects of such great power? It's just not typical street gang behavior, that's all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4222705722" "I was worried it might be something like that. {HeroName}, I think the Hellions have been using artifacts like this to wrest territory from other gangs. That's why they're spreading so far and so fast! If I'm right, they could be a much greater threat than we imagined."
